ks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 8}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dans la section de l'échantillon, cliquez sur le menu déroulant "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Type d'échantillon", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sample Type", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc1qtZ65k2duCcC7NpH5P6Pmc_qrAMjHKs56W1srzcfOCdPDsXaOOV9bN1TFfUP1BBQNd5WRWHrowSrv8s31S1DRvRXG8-7VILsj6d3Ea7w5akQqueVxLUoef8Rg1T-vGXPOGUB3EG8SqLIP3SO_WOmW21t?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 150}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur le menu déroulant Type d'échantillon", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 9}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionnez l'échantillon dans le menu déroulant. Dans cet exemple, le type d'échantillon sélectionné est Stool culture"}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeUoSGQ4gyGT3Mh8ZOpOUterBGLil7uRFGMHFoTB26H9e9Z2lrjKXFFjvpsVT9lI_YcIbG9HR2A4rOiDt2PqemS_2fH8Mr9k5hBUWb7snO7OaLz14p7Iezq-lNcU-FBVU4R8aF0XJd4hosAJEdCbaqXOt-J?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 523}}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 10}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cochez la ou les cases correspondant aux panels d'analyses et analyses souhaités. Dans cet exemple, la case stool culture est cochée."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarque : le nombre de panels d'analyses et d'analyses disponibles dépend du type d'échantillon (sérum, plasma, sang, urine). Le type d'échantillon et l'analyse sont identiques pour tout le lot saisi."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfFqaY53zRTKiM9OkwIYvz1RnMcJnzqL3ClHU0I-0yxYOKja-kN2R7c0y-oiJZIRwJvALX9Pfb1Li-lACGzfRxO5UNiAYPf7ahZRrg4Hsnp4HiW8Ck_rSbjwhDwQBCbUz5HgH7_CNgYGVlBEEgcCVLq2AM-?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 251}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionner les panels d'analyses et les analyses disponibles ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 11}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": " Dans la section Configure Barcode Entry, sélectionnez la "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Barcode Method ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "dans la liste déroulante. Choisissez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Demande anticipée ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Pre-Printed", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") si vos étiquettes code-barres sont déjà imprimées. Choisissez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "À la demande ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "("}, {"type": "text", "text": "On Demand", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") si vous imprimez l'étiquette code-barres complète depuis OpenELIS. "}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4